(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-56","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["程雾在上午回来，说接收点床位[[adequate|足够]]，六个孩子睡下之后，她才敢[[utter|说出]]一句放心。我们在路边分吃[[onion|洋葱]]饼，脚下钢板随货车[[vibrate|颤动]]。站内有人敲着铁[[drum|圆桶]]赶工，老陈把一截[[sausage|香肠]]塞回袋里，等杜医生来吃。他看起来[[hopeful|满怀希望的]]，程雾却说孩子的害怕仍然[[tremendous|极大]]，今天最[[realistic|切实可行的]]帮助是保住他们的床，而不是为追车[[create|制造]]另一场惊险。她把接收回执交给我看，名字逐个对齐，一个也没有少。","她还带回一个磨损的[[tag|标签]]，是从孩子携带的饭盒外袋上取下的。我觉得[[curious|奇怪]]，旧袋号竟与退货车吻合。这样的[[indirect|间接的]]联系必须回到每个[[individual|个人]]经历上，不能把[[ugly|可怕的]]后果归给一个孩子。管理员嫌家属是[[nuisance|麻烦人物]]，说他们把旧年[[earthquake|地震]]援助物资也带来闹事。杜医生到站时压下自己的[[excitement|激动]]，拿出诊所[[council|委员会]]的决定，要求[[enforce|执行]]暂缓回收安排。老人于是敢把剩下的回执摆上桌，标签首次不再只是孤零零的一张纸。","文件夹里有外国[[embassy|大使馆]]捐赠批文，日期中的[[dash|破折号]]却同车单格式不同。一位做[[sociology|社会学]]田野调查的志愿者来帮助[[link|连接]]家属与接收点，辨出两套[[distinct|不同的]]编号。程雾把录音机[[tune|调节]]到昨天的声音，说这不是公开控诉的[[drama|戏剧]]；她只要确认车辆经过的时间，以免损害孩子的[[security|安全]]。老陈帮她[[organize|整理]]回执，外头[[continual|接连不断的]]敲桶声却让她停了手。那声音与她在接收点听见的背景一样，意味着车曾先去另一扇门。","接收点门上挂着安慰孩子的[[balloon|气球]]，视频只存了[[limited|有限的]]片段。一台[[idle|闲置的]]送货车就停在敲桶声旁。司机带着海边[[accent|口音]]，不愿再做[[passive|被动的]]见证人，承认那车原先运输[[fertilizer|肥料]]。同一[[carrier|运载工具]]后来拉过回收箱，[[corresponding|相应的]]清洁记录却找不到。他先前的[[response|答复]]是照着经理教的话说的。程雾没有追问每个孩子是否闻到怪味，而请他指认车号，防止恐惧替代真实记忆。","杜医生查出回收单把旧物重量记作[[ounce|盎司]]，车载秤却用另一单位。破袋开始[[emit|散发]]异味，老陈说自己并不[[intend|打算]]在这里开箱，立即请专业人员接手。这项[[abrupt|突然的]]决定让[[spacious|宽敞的]]棚下清出一条路；经理表示[[disapproval|不赞成]]，怕整个站停工。司机们却[[spontaneous|自发]]地把午饭搬到[[cafeteria|食堂]]，留下未触动的[[virgin|原封未用的]]外包装供检验。我们只拍了标签，没有拆封；工人的退后也替病册上的人争到一点不被继续忽略的时间。","程雾发现能[[afflict|使人苦恼]]的并非敲桶声，而是声音里一段被删去的调度呼叫。她没有[[reproach|责备]]司机晚说，只让他听完整副本。录音中的经理说‘先接完孩子再换车’，下一句则是‘病册跟退货一起走’。我们把这两句话连同接收点视频交给何警官，杜医生要求留下病册原件。经理第一次不敢在桌上抢文件。天色阴了，程雾重新把耳机收好，说接下来不追快车，我们去找那本仍未交出的母册。老陈捡起冷了的饼，给每个人都留了一块。"],"en":["Cheng returned that morning. Beds were [[adequate|adequate]]; only after all six children slept could she [[utter|utter]] a reassuring word. We shared [[onion|onion]] cakes by the road while steel plates began to [[vibrate|vibrate]] beneath trucks. Someone struck a metal [[drum|drum]] inside. Chen saved a piece of [[sausage|sausage]] for Du, looking [[hopeful|hopeful]]. Cheng said the children's fear remained [[tremendous|tremendous]]: the most [[realistic|realistic]] help was preserving their beds, rather than chasing a truck to [[create|create]] another emergency. She showed me the reception receipt and checked every name. All six had arrived safely.","She brought a worn [[tag|tag]] removed from a child's lunch-container bag. Its number matched the return vehicle, which seemed [[curious|curious]]. This [[indirect|indirect]] connection required an [[individual|individual]] history, not blame for an [[ugly|ugly]] outcome placed on a child. An administrator called families a [[nuisance|nuisance]], claiming they had brought old [[earthquake|earthquake]] donations to cause trouble. Du controlled his [[excitement|excitement]] and produced the clinic [[council|council]] decision to [[enforce|enforce]] a pause in collection. The elderly man then laid out more receipts; the label was no longer an isolated scrap.","The folder contained foreign [[embassy|embassy]] donation papers, but the date's [[dash|dash]] differed from the truck form. A volunteer conducting [[sociology|sociology]] fieldwork helped [[link|link]] families to the reception centre and identified two [[distinct|distinct]] numbering systems. Cheng began to [[tune|tune]] her recorder to yesterday's sound. This was no public denunciation [[drama|drama]]; she sought a passing time without harming the children's [[security|security]]. Chen helped [[organize|organize]] receipts. The [[continual|continual]] banging outside made her pause: it matched the reception recording's background, suggesting the truck had first visited a different entrance.","A comforting [[balloon|balloon]] hung at reception, where video storage held [[limited|limited]] footage. An [[idle|idle]] delivery truck stood beside the banging. Its driver, speaking with a coastal [[accent|accent]], refused to remain [[passive|passive]]: the vehicle had previously transported [[fertilizer|fertilizer]]. This same [[carrier|carrier]] later moved returned boxes, yet its [[corresponding|corresponding]] cleaning record was missing. His earlier [[response|response]] repeated the manager's instructions. Cheng did not ask whether every child had smelled something strange. She asked him to identify the vehicle, preventing fear from replacing a reliable memory.","Du discovered that a return sheet used [[ounce|ounce]] measurements, unlike the truck's scales. A torn bag began to [[emit|emit]] an odour. Chen did not [[intend|intend]] to open it and summoned qualified staff. His [[abrupt|abrupt]] decision cleared a passage across the [[spacious|spacious]] shelter. The manager expressed [[disapproval|disapproval]], fearing closure. Drivers made a [[spontaneous|spontaneous]] move to the [[cafeteria|cafeteria]] with their lunches, leaving [[virgin|virgin]] outer packaging for examination. We photographed labels without breaking seals. Their withdrawal also won patients a little time in which their concerns could no longer simply be ignored.","What could [[afflict|afflict]] Cheng was not the banging but a dispatch call removed from a recording. She did not [[reproach|reproach]] the driver for speaking late; she played an uncut copy. The manager said, 'Finish receiving the children before changing trucks,' followed by, 'Send the patient register with the returns.' We gave the recording and reception video to He. Du demanded retention of the original register. The manager no longer grabbed papers across the desk. Cheng packed her headphones: we would seek the missing master register instead of racing vehicles. Chen divided the cold cakes, saving a share for everyone."]});
